    "detailed_description": "Jump4 is a game that you can play with only one button : SPACE<br><br><br>There are certain jump loops every level and each time you press SPACE you jump according to where you are in the loop.<br><br>    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607710/extras/6fd0e21303cc0ae1ef23231f15990b4f.avif?t=1754592470\" width=320 height=320 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Jump to reach the triangle.<br></li><li>Follow the jumping loops.<br></li><li>You have limited jumps for every level.<br></li><li>Please do not try to use W,A,S,D.<br></li><li>Remember that you can pass most levels in different ways!<br></li><li>Challenging levels for some people, a little bit less challenging for some other people.<br>     <br>          <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607710/extras/3999f531a52420536916e0fcfbeab90f.poster.avif?t=1754592470\" width=508 height=508 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607710/extras/3999f531a52420536916e0fcfbeab90f.webm?t=1754592470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607710/extras/3999f531a52420536916e0fcfbeab90f.mp4?t=1754592470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features i guess</h2><br></li><li>Poorly made pixelart.<br></li><li>A user interface made by the developer's lack of ui knowledge.<br></li><li>Non-intrusive sound effects.<br></li><li>Unique game design.</li></ul>",
